<title>USA: Terra Nitrogen Co LP Q1 falls.</title>
<headline>Terra Nitrogen Co LP Q1 falls.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY, Iowa 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per Unit amounts)</p>
<p>							Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							   March 31,</p>
<p>							1997	     1996</p>
<p> Revenues					$ 74,045	$ 89,304</p>
<p> Other income					 134	     144</p>
<p> Total net revenues			    74,179	  89,448</p>
<p> Cost of goods sold			    42,509	  35,242</p>
<p> Gross profit				    31,670	  54,206</p>
<p> Operating expenses			     2,970	   3,035</p>
<p> Operating income				28,700	  51,171</p>
<p> Interest expense				 (434)	   (126)</p>
<p> Interest income				  1,526	   1,953</p>
<p> Net Income					29,792	  52,998</p>
<p> Net income per limited partnership unit   1.44	    1.98</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said Q1 1997 earnings due vs year ago due to lower nitrogen solutions sales volumes and higher natural gas costs. The company makes nitrogen fertilizer products.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
